<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Jinro Group to sell affiliates, property. [CORRECTED 01:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Jinro Group to sell affiliates, property. [CORRECTED 01:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's troubled Jinro Group said on Thursday it would sell 12 of its 18 affiliates and real estate to raise over 840 billion won (corrects from 84 billion won) by the end of this year to rescue six affiliates set for bailout.</p>
</text>
